==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is rather easy. Even simply using [[Eraser Cat|Wall Cat]] and [[Paris Cat]] can clear it without too much trouble. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] makes this level a joke.

